1065
00:45:20,090 --> 00:45:22,340
Does just more scale
and pre-training data

1066
00:45:22,340 --> 00:45:26,660
help as well for low-resource
machine translation?

1067
00:45:26,660 --> 00:45:28,010
Yeah, yeah, good question.

1068
00:45:28,010 --> 00:45:29,593
Actually, there have
been some studies

1069
00:45:29,593 --> 00:45:31,710
done on how these systems work.

1070
00:45:31,710 --> 00:45:33,290
I think for
high-resource languages,

1071
00:45:33,290 --> 00:45:36,290
it's actually quite
beneficial to scale up.

1072
00:45:36,290 --> 00:45:38,690
I think part of that is
because the models have

1073
00:45:38,690 --> 00:45:41,195
some innate generalization,
and so one of the challenges

1074
00:45:41,195 --> 00:45:43,820
that people talk about different
things in different languages.

1075
00:45:43,820 --> 00:45:46,670
So seeing that knowledge
in another language

1076
00:45:46,670 --> 00:45:48,470
can actually help
the generalization.

1077
00:45:48,470 --> 00:45:52,880
But on low-resource languages,
yeah, the performance

1078
00:45:52,880 --> 00:45:56,840
is pretty difficult, especially
on some of these translation

1079
00:45:56,840 --> 00:45:57,710
benchmarks.

1080
00:45:57,710 --> 00:46:00,020
I also think that
language models,

1081
00:46:00,020 --> 00:46:02,900
in terms of being trained
for a translation objective,

1082
00:46:02,900 --> 00:46:05,300
tend to score worse on
translation benchmarks

1083
00:46:05,300 --> 00:46:07,490
because language models
are approximately

1084
00:46:07,490 --> 00:46:08,630
capturing the same thing.

1085
00:46:08,630 --> 00:46:10,250
Whereas translation
models, you're

1086
00:46:10,250 --> 00:46:13,770
really try to align the
meaning a little bit more.

1087
00:46:13,770 --> 00:46:14,310
But yeah.

1088
00:46:14,310 --> 00:46:17,490
So I think for low resource,
still pretty challenging.

1089
00:46:17,490 --> 00:46:18,120
But yeah.

1090
00:46:18,120 --> 00:46:21,180
One thing that's interesting
is for most English language

1091
00:46:21,180 --> 00:46:23,370
models, they can actually
do a reasonable job

1092
00:46:23,370 --> 00:46:25,320
