1134
00:48:16,930 --> 00:48:19,780
So for our
large-scale mining, we

1135
00:48:19,780 --> 00:48:22,780
don't mind every single
possible cross pair.

1136
00:48:22,780 --> 00:48:27,190
So like Icelandic
Wolof, it's probably

1137
00:48:27,190 --> 00:48:29,890
