1140
00:48:35,830 --> 00:48:38,200
And so that's where the
zero-shot results come from,

1141
00:48:38,200 --> 00:48:43,360
where we don't have training
data directionally in that pair,

1142
00:48:43,360 --> 00:48:46,300
but the model has seen both
the input and the output.

1143
00:48:46,300 --> 00:48:50,020
And so I think those
