researchers.

1203
00:51:25,310 --> 00:51:28,010
And they worked very
differently But now,

1204
00:51:28,010 --> 00:51:29,960
it's all driven by the
same underlying thing,

1205
00:51:29,960 --> 00:51:32,210
and you're not like a
specialized summarization

1206
00:51:32,210 --> 00:51:33,740
researcher anymore.

1207
00:51:33,740 --> 00:51:36,360

1208
00:51:36,360 --> 00:51:38,145
I think that makes
a lot of sense.

